	 Welcome to our Website! 

								 
 
 COUNTY DIRECTORY 
 














	 View election results here 









 Welcome to the most southeastern territory in the great state of Idaho . . .Bear Lake County This county offers paradise to any outdoor enthusiast, embraces its rural pioneer heritage, thrives on its agricultural and tourism industries, and is proud of its quality and quiet way of life. This web site is designed with important information about the various services provided by the County of Bear Lake. Please browse our website to uncover the reasons why Bear Lake County is the best-kept secret in the state of Idaho! Assessor's Interactive Parcel Map To find tax amounts using the parcel map: Search for parcel Click on the highlighted PIN number Click the Identify tab Click again on the parcel on the map Parcel Map Link 

 Bear Lake County Property Assessment Appeal Form Application and Permit for Snowplowing of County Roads Bear Lake County Encroachment Permit - Return to  [email protected] Bear Lake West Encroachment Permit - Return to  [email protected] Bear Lake County Utilities Requirement Form - Return to  [email protected] Bear Lake County Title VI Plan for Idaho Transportation Department Federal Highway Administration Subrecipient 







 COMMISSIONERS MEETING The Regular County Commissioners Meeting will be held the second and forth Mondays of each month, unless otherwise noted. The agenda will be posted here the Friday prior to the meeting.  ​​ See Agenda If you would like to sign up to receive notices of County Commissioner Meeting  CLICK HERE . Bear Lake County Commissioners' 2026 Regular Meeting Schedule   ​​ 

 PUBLIC NOTICE The Bear Lake County Commissioners may attend the Four-County Commissioners' meeting scheduled for September 9, 2026.  See the agenda here . St. Charles Area of Impact Map and Hearing Notice ​ St Charles Area of Impact proposed Ordinance ​Bloomington Area of Impact Map and Hearing Notice Bloomington Area of Impact proposed Ordinance 2026 Land Use Plan Update Initiative Pocatello Regional Transit Information ​Check Your Voter Status   Planning and Zoning Meeting Agenda  ​ Job Openings ​ Bear Lake County Job Application  Bear Lake County Sheriff's Office Probation Officer Job Description and Application ​ ​ 

 Important Dates To Remember 

 Local elections are coming up! What you see (or don’t see) on your ballot depends on where you live. ​ Take a minute to check your sample ballot and registration status at  www.voteidaho.gov . 







 
   
     
       
       
     
   


